Santoni PAS-owned cache preflight: checked physical-aperture and CPU aliases.
Separate explicit mode3/zap/cache role; no firmware, SMC or GPU continuation.
General-use RAM is mapped with unhinted pages at bootstrap; live blocks are never split.

